{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a short narrative visual novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows the protagonist, who left his hometown for the city years ago due to a misunderstanding. Though he often wished to return, he never found the courage to do so. One day, during a period of disappointment and emotional low, he meets a blue-haired girl. Mysterious and seemingly aware of everything about him, she encourages him to go back. With her support, he finally sets out on a journey home in search of an answer to something missing within himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple story endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light exploration and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emphasis on psychological and emotional themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven with a strong focus on story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and soothing musical atmosphere</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517670?t=1752702354","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3517670?t=1752702354","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517670/3dfa3aeb18348f467bcbe4ff3768fd872aa1e009/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752702354","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517670/3dfa3aeb18348f467bcbe4ff3768fd872aa1e009/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752702354","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a short narrative visual novel.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows the protagonist, who left his hometown for the city years ago due to a